world  revised passive chain approximation

-- All movable bodies start from rest.
-- Initial hinge angles are zero; starting orientations are geometric.
-- Gravity uses the compiler default. Dead contacts approximate restitution.
-- Frictionless guide contacts approximate ideal axial slide constraints.
-- The cart1 torsional pusher approximates the unavailable axial spring.
-- Linear slide damping cannot be specified in this language.
-- Auxiliary strikers and a tilted cart2 receiving face are approximations.
-- Expectations are tests to run, not claims of verified success.

